<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97344" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρω-τήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rafter laid upon</i> the bearing beam; mostly in pl.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				72
			</span></i>; of a drunken man, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν μὴ δύνηταί τις τοὺς στρωτῆρας
					ἢ τὰς δοκοὺς ἀριθμεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Vert.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1672.63
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				42(1).102.179
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				235
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				87.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.89.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(3).324.11
			</span></i> (Thera, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>): generally,
			<i>cross-beam</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				7
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				78
			</span></i>; expld. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σανίδες εἰς ὀροφὴν
				ἐπιτήδειοι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				302
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοκοί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.4.13
			</span></i>; difft.  from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοκοί</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπότομα</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1546.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>.</div>
